				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "Kinetic age!"
			x: -1.9196428571428612d
			y: -2.9821428571428577d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1B09ABB4A5E9F305"]
			description: ["If you are unsure how these work, you should probably take a look at some create tutorials online."]
