		{
			dependencies: ["4AE5A00B6C2987DE"]
			description: [
				"The millstone can grind down most ingots into dust, and doesn't cost you any tool durability!"
				""
				"Millstones and crushing wheels are a good alternative for ingot crushing, as they're fast and inexpensive, but lategame gregtech stuff can get much faster."
			]
			id: "6C3F5AB5E2270798"
			subtitle: "Throw away those mortars!"
