		{
			dependencies: ["1B09ABB4A5E9F305"]
			description: [
				"There are some notable changes to create recipes in this pack. Namely:"
				"- Electron tubes can be substituted by any ULV circuit."
				"- Dried kelp can be substituted by any rubber sheet."
				"- There is an assembler recipe for precision mechanisms, in case you'll need those later."
			]
			id: "4FBDA488D826BDE3"
			subtitle: "Wow, proper gregtech integration!"
			tasks: [{
				id: "6DD77929BB8AE2B1"
