			}]
			x: 1.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4AE5A00B6C2987DE"]
			description: [
				"When blowing through certain blocks, these can perform some recipes on items."
				""
				"- Lava will let these smelt items in bulk! Works with anything you can smelt in a vanilla blast furnace. Time to make a ton of wrought iron!"
				"- Fire will let you cook things in bulk! Putting food under lava will just void it, sorry."
				"- Water will let you wash things in bulk! This doesn't give you any gregtech byproducts, but can be useful in some cases."
				"- Soulfire will let you haunt stuff! There isn't much use for it, though."
			]
			id: "0C1B1877D7B83B14"
			subtitle: "Multi smelter before a multi smelter!"
			tasks: [{
				id: "059BFEF7E4933033"
				item: "create:encased_fan"
				type: "item"
