			]
			description: [
				"Technically, you could've made a pipe pistol a lot earlier, but that would still require you to make ammo, which needs a deployer."
				""
				"Now, you can make all the create armory guns! While all of those are craftable right now, it's perfectly valid to just wait until you get an assembler and a canner so that ammo production is a lot easier."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Pro tip: the Barret will give you the most bang for your buck when it comes to ammo production. It one-shots almost anything, too!"
